// Reuse the post-merge payload-building and Engine-API packages from the engine
// simulator (client, clmock, helper, globals, config, types) from this checkout
// rather than a pinned proxy version, so the APIs match exactly. The build
// context is the parent directory (see hive_context.txt) so ../engine resolves
// inside the Docker build too.
replace github.com/ethereum/hive/simulators/ethereum/engine => ../engine
